 :cli/agent-usage "cljpass agent - access for an LLM session (talks to the unlocked UI)

  cljpass agent status
  cljpass agent find [WORDS] [--history]         entries without secrets (--history: older versions too)
  cljpass agent show ID|TITLE                    entry without password and protected fields
  cljpass agent history ID|TITLE                 versions; same password = same password-group
  cljpass agent set ID|TITLE [--title T] [--username U] [--url URL] [--notes N] [--folder F]
                     [--tags A;B] [--add-tags A] [--field NAME=VALUE ...] [--remove-field NAME ...]
  cljpass agent new --title T [...like set] [--generate]
  cljpass agent generate ID|TITLE [--length N]   new password, Claude does not see it
  cljpass agent delete ID|TITLE                  into the recycle bin
  cljpass agent group [PARENT] NAME
  cljpass agent rotation                         what rotations exist here (the plugins describe themselves)
  cljpass agent rotate ID|TITLE [--code 123456] [--probe]
                                                 change the password AT THE TARGET (the human releases it;
                                                 a code wherever the entry has a TOTP). Claude never sees it.
  cljpass agent ssh ID|TITLE [--minutes 30]      SSH channel (a human approves), then: ssh -S SOCKET x COMMAND
  cljpass agent channels | ssh-close NAME
  cljpass agent secret old|new                   only FOR a running changer (one-time token)

Writing only with \"Tools > Claude may write\". Every change gets the tag \"claude\"." :cli/rotate-none "No entry names a changer this machine knows (field \"{field}\")."
 :cli/rotate-plugins "Rotation plugins ({file}, directories: {dirs}):"}
